{
  "format": 2,
  "cpu": "c14",
  "comment": "SCADA: an oven heater controlled from the screen. The slider sets the wanted temperature (AM2, in tenths of a degree: 600 = 60.0 °C). The PT100 on I8 measures it (AI2). The comparator switches the heater on Q1 on when the oven is at least 0.5 °C below the setting and off when it reaches it. Change the PT100 temperature on the Control Panel to see the heater react.",
